HANDOVER PACK: {{ system }} ({{ f.domain }})
{{ "=" * (("HANDOVER PACK: " ~ system ~ " (" ~ f.domain ~ ")") | length) }}

Client: {{ client.get("name") or NP }}
Vendor: {{ vendor.get("name") or NP }}
Date:   {{ (bast.date | date) if bast.get("date") else NP }}
Made with dejavu {{ dejavu }} from ansibro {{ f.ansibro.version or NP }}.
{% if draft %}

THIS IS A DRAFT. Do not sign or hand it over: some answers are still missing.
